   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[casual, dropping a bomb] 胡克说过，引力定律有他一份功劳。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[furious] Hooke!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[ranting] He wanted my credit. I nearly cut Book Three.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[needling] 您就这么不想发表？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[prickly] Who would understand it?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[dry, sour] At Cambridge, I often lectured to walls.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[deadpan] 墙，辛苦了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sly] 胡克去世第二年，您就出了《光学》？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flat, too quick, dodging] My friends insisted. Next question.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "v3_S3_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[sweet, going for it] 好。微积分是莱布尼茨发明的吧？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[exploding] Leibniz? It was mine!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 那皇家学会怎么判的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[proud, composed] A committee looked into it. Very fair.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[innocent] 会长，委员谁选的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[proud] I did.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quicker] 报告谁写的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[prouder] I did.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quicker still] 夸报告的文章，谁写的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[natural] Anonymous.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[deadpan] 也是他。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cold fury] Out. Now.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "v3_S4_s1727",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1727,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[puzzled] 这写的什么？像密码。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sharp] Give me that.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sincere, careful] 您为什么威胁要烧死他们？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[matter-of-fact] At birth, I could fit in that. My father was already dead.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[matter-of-fact, tight] At three, my mother married again. She left me with my grandmother.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sincere] 那您……原谅她了吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[steady, holding it in] When she was dying, I sat up whole nights with her.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[steady, voice catching] I dressed her blisters with my own hands.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[moved, trying to sound professional] ……时间到了。谢谢您，牛顿爵士。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[gruff] Sit down. Next question.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[delighted, teary, teasing] 那……苹果到底砸没砸到您的头？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[exasperated, fighting a smile] For the last time. It did not hit my head.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "9d48e632126e47fa24331617611c4fab3fbb61beadec42067817c28ade5f332f",
      "voice_id": "dUercWozs0yhe4xBCgZ0",
      "name": "Mandrake"
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}